/// gh-1724 follow-up: end-to-end CLI coverage for the gh-1680 message-cap
/// repair wiring (PR #1695). The loop/store/coalesce logic has unit suites
/// (test/agent/message_cap_*), but the CLI-side wiring — the learned-cap
