              ToolCall(
                id: 't$i',
                name: 'read',
                arguments: {'path': 'note.txt'},
              ),
            ]),
          textTurn('pre-emptive summary'),
          textTurn('prompt four answered after the gate'),
        ];
        final fake = FakeStreamFunction(turns);
        final cli = _bootCli(
          env: env,
          io: io,
          homeDir: tempHome.path,
          stream: fake.call,
