       _agent.state.messages.length,
       _modelCaps.learnedCapFor(model),
     ) ||
     _modelCaps.takePremptivePass(model.provider, model.id);
}
``

`_modelCaps` is the STORE — the pin tier does NOT apply to the gate! The pin only applies via `_CliMessageCapPolicy.learnedCapFor` (the loop's heal path). So the boot gate uses the STORE's 64 → trigger 48 → not reached → no fire. That's the PRODUCTION behavior — the pin tier is (deliberately or not) not consulted by the gate.

